IMAPAccount gmail
Host imap.gmail.com
User you@gmail.com
AuthMechs XOAUTH2
PassCmd "~/.config/neomutt/oauth/mutt_oauth2.py ~/.config/neomutt/oauth/gmail.token"
SSLType IMAPS

IMAPStore gmail-remote
Account gmail
MaildirStore gmail-local
Path ~/Mail/gmail/
Inbox ~/Mail/gmail/Inbox
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel gmail
Far :gmail-remote:
Near :gmail-local:
Patterns *
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *

IMAPAccount other
Host imap.example.com
User you@example.com
PassCmd "pass mail/other"
SSLType IMAPS
IMAPStore other-remote
Account other
MaildirStore other-local
Path ~/Mail/other/
Inbox ~/Mail/other/Inbox
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel other
Far :other-remote:
Near :other-local:
Patterns *
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *
